<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-30T02:04:16.364Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:04:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan has resumed airstrikes in southern Syria against Daesh militants, prompting Syrian condemnation and reports of civilian casualties. Syrian security forces killed a French jihadist in Harem and another French fighter in Idlib, while unidentified gunmen killed two Syrian defence ministry personnel in Idlib. The Nasib border crossing has reopened and a joint security committee and investigation into the strikes have been agreed between Jordan and Syria. Heavy rain and flash floods have killed five people, including four children, in different parts of Syria. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/unacceptable-violation-syria-condemns-jordan-airstrikes&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOdHFuTnlKdUxQNFE3RVJQVkRyWEd6UERyNnpOelVYak0tMU1OekpmWEJySmVMY3JaN25XNWRoY2gxSkhHbjRoOFFaR3hiZk5oVnZfOFZIT2ZvUjJ0T2I0QmpUUGdzTUdVdkVnMkVTLURBNEJmNTZBOXVGTEh5R0EyVzVpS0pZU3poQmd4aFE0YnJ2SXdPejhNbUFkRndveUVUWU42OXdjZnUzbTJKY3Rkc1ozeV9FbURlR2pnREhmMUc0VkNySE9LYmltcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;VOA - Voice of America English News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaleej Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOQkp5REFjM1J4RGJLNFgtbkt6Tm9rN204MC01cUFRWDZ1cjF3bm9pWDVpOGJpenAtUEgxM2xGT2hWR1ZVZ3ZzcHhZRTdIaGNTdURsbzgwVVUtODVLUzhIbV9DcHk3cHB1TEZGTkNUOTNla2EyTFRFTkZOeFlzM2xjSVFhV1Y0dzZsMGFQZDh2QS1pdUNpYU1DeXhwbkZnUUt1OEJvZjlnVVZJV1dZUzRTNTlLbi1sSkxCTjI4dnNoV0Z0Mmtv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Australian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ShiaWaves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
